# Painlevé–Gullstrand ↔ Eddington–Finkelstein (same `ε`): the actual coordinate map on all of `domEF`

For `M ≥ 0`, `ε = ±1`, on the **whole** PG/EF domain `domEF = {r > 0, 0 < θ < π}` — the points
